# Six-Quotient Growth Engine

Little Nate measures his own clinical performance after every interaction and crystallizes growth lessons from his weaknesses. This is the mechanism by which Nate gets BETTER over time — not through prompt engineering, but through lived experience crystals.

## Architecture

```
User sends message → AI responds
  ↓ (fire-and-forget, zero latency)
SixQuotientGrowthEngine.assess_interaction()
  ├─ Detect quotient dimensions in client message (regex, ≥2 hits)
  ├─ Assess Nate's response: positive signals vs anti-patterns
  ├─ Log to six_quotient_growth table
  └─ If anti-patterns found → crystallize_lesson() → nate_intelligence_crystals
  
Background (6h cycle):
  _synthesize_growth()
  ├─ Aggregate 24h of growth entries
  ├─ Identify persistent weaknesses per quotient
  ├─ Forge "PERSISTENT WEAKNESS" crystals (high confidence 0.80)
  └─ Store daily quotient snapshot for trajectory tracking
```

