## Anti-Pattern Detection (6 Anti-Patterns)

| Anti-Pattern | What Nate Did Wrong | Correction |
|---|---|---|
| `banned_word` | Used liminal, threshold, holding space, etc. | Use client's OWN words or concrete sensory description |
| `metaphor_decode` | Said "represents," "symbolizes," "is really about" | Enter the image and explore within it |
| `solution_offering` | Offered coping strategies for unsolvable problems | "I don't have anything that fixes this. I can sit here with you." |
| `accommodation` | Agreed to client's controlling rules | Name the parallel process: "You are doing to me what…" |
| `intellectualization_trap` | Validated client's clinical analysis | Somatic interrupt: "Put the clipboard down. What is your chest doing?" |
| `generic_validation` | Used "I hear you," "that must be," "how brave" | Replace with specific clinical observation using client's own words |

